== L. pg_database_owner: is there any statement that removes it?
L REVOKE pg_database_owner FROM r3_mig: no error; notices: ['WARNING: role "r3_mig" has not been granted membership in role "pg_database_owner" by role "postgres"']
L REVOKE pg_database_owner FROM r3_mig GRANTED BY postgres: no error; notices: ['WARNING: role "r3_mig" has not been granted membership in role "pg_database_owner" by role "postgres"']
